<Base title="Privacy policy (draft) | Tessera" description="How Tessera handles your information. Draft pending review." noindex>
  <Prose title="Privacy policy" draft intro="Written from how the app actually behaves today. It must be reviewed, completed with the owner's legal details, and approved before publication.">
    <h2>What the app does with your files</h2>
    <p>Tessera reads file and folder names, sizes, dates and attributes on your computer to build its storage map. This information stays on your computer. The app does not read file contents and does not upload anything.</p>
    <h2>Network connections</h2>
    <p>The current version of the app makes no network connections. Future versions may contact a licensing service to activate a Pro licence and may check for updates. Those requests will not include file names, folders or scan results. This policy will be updated before such features ship.</p>
    <h2>Settings stored on your computer</h2>
    <p>The app stores your preferences, such as theme and size display, in its local storage on your computer. No file names or paths are stored.</p>
    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>This website does not use cookies, analytics or tracking scripts. Hosting providers may keep standard server logs; details will be added once hosting is chosen.</p>
    <h2>Payments</h2>
    <p>Purchases are not yet available. When they are, payment will be handled by a third-party payment provider, and Tessera will not receive or store card details.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Contact details will be added before publication.</p>
  </Prose>
</Base>
